  "contentHtml": "<p>#밀도 #설탕 #농도 #부피 #질량 #부력<br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba42b41f88caae341988660579a551be6cccb7bd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba42b41f88caae341988660579a551be6cccb7bd\" data-origin-width=\"475\" data-origin-height=\"543\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7cfd39904ca1da3f8341761c7618774feda4c4dd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7cfd39904ca1da3f8341761c7618774feda4c4dd\" data-origin-width=\"321\" data-origin-height=\"197\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">콜라와 제로 콜라의 밀도를<br>물의 밀도와 비교해볼수도 있겠고,<br>농도도 계산하고 비교해볼수도 있겠습니다.<br>알루미늄캔의 밀도, 빈공간의 부피<br>등을 측정하고, 부력 단원에서도 쓸 수 있을것 같네요~^^<br><br>연결자료 - 콜라의 설탕 농도<br><a href=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eyYq/206\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eyYq/206</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"모든 이야기의 시작 - Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"모든 이야기의 시작, Daum 카페\" data-og-host=\"m.cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eyYq/206\" data-og-url=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/_cafeTop\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/7nFqQ/dJMb88Gerpw/8TBQlUMrUkcMKIjTcdvtpK/kakaolink40_original.png?width=1200&amp;height=628\"><a href=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eyYq/206\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eyYq/206\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/7nFqQ/dJMb88Gerpw/8TBQlUMrUkcMKIjTcdvtpK/kakaolink40_original.png?width=1200&amp;height=628\" alt=\"\" xxx